<title>USA: Weeks Corp Q4 net rises to $0.28/shr.</title>
<headline>Weeks Corp Q4 net rises to $0.28/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited; in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		     Three Mo.   Three Mo.     Year    Year</p>
<p>			Ended	 Ended	Ended    Ended</p>
<p>		     12-31-96    12-31-95    12-31-96 12-31-95</p>
<p>Revenue	    $15,820     $11,556     $53,883  $35,271</p>
<p>Net income	   3,519	 2,347	12,745    8,426</p>
<p>Net per share	$0.28	 $0.24	 $1.11    $1.03</p>
<p>Av shrs	     12,556	 9,642	11,512    8,171</p>
<p>Funds from opers   $6,733	$4,622(1)  $23,640  $14,662(1)</p>
<p>Funds from operations</p>
<p> per share	    $0.54	 $0.48(1)    $2.05    $1.79(1)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year (1) Restated to reflect the adoption of new NAREIT guidelines for computing funds from operations. The impact of the restatement was to reduce per share funds from operations for the three months ended December 31, 1995, to $0.48 from the $0.49 reported previously, and to reduce per share funds from operations for the year ended December 31, 1995, to $1.79 from the $1.86 reported previously.</p>
